WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.461
Open Archived Calls from the Omni Dispatch menu to
review calls that have already closed.

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:11.743
This is useful when a caller asks about earlier
activity or a team needs context for a follow-up.

00:00:12.063 --> 00:00:16.031
Choose Filters to see the available choices,
including Closed As.

00:00:16.211 --> 00:00:20.819
Use the status filter to focus on the type of
closeout you need to review.

00:00:21.139 --> 00:00:24.275
Use the search box to find the archived call by name.

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:27.100
Here we find the fictional community standby.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.523
Check the call number and closed status before
opening it.

00:00:30.843 --> 00:00:34.725
Call Details keeps the original description with its
call number.

00:00:34.905 --> 00:00:39.343
A security dispatcher could use it to identify an
earlier site incident.

00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:43.917
A wildland contractor could use it to confirm which
exercise was closed.

00:00:44.237 --> 00:00:49.208
Open History to review previous calls at this
location when they are available.

00:00:49.388 --> 00:00:54.636
Check the exact call number and the details before
using an earlier call as context.
